    [Bugfix] Support mix C8 && BF16 layers for layerwise reuse in prefill offload (#18318)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    The existing prefill layerwise reuse layout only supports uniform size
    for each spec. By enabling indexer C8, GLM5.2 might have some indexer
    layers fall back to BF16. This causes the layerwise merge to fail. This
    PR fix it by allocating the largest size of buffer across all indexer
    layers (like BF16), and view the corresponding part for potential C8
    tensors.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    No.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/ced6857afa0ea7b2e3f0846a62e1394e90f15607
    
    ---------
    
    Signed-off-by: Angazenn <supperccell@163.com>

